    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Porto Rocha is a global brand identity and strategy studio founded by Leo Porto and Felipe Rocha, both Brazilian-born creative directors. Leo Porto: ex-COLLINS, Pentagram, Mother, CGH. Felipe Rocha: ex-Spotify, Sagmeister and Walsh, AGI member. Studio founded circa 2016, based in Brooklyn NY with a London office opened 2026; team estimated 50+ across designers, strategists, motion directors. Notable clients: Google (DeepMind, Gemini), Nike, Twitch, Netflix, Robinhood, W Hotels, MASP, Kunsthalle Basel, Sundance. Strong identity systems practice with supporting brand strategy, editorial/graphic design, type, and spatial work. Senior/director-level founders; studio operates as an autonomous creative entity. Work Status = Studio (self-directed practice, not freelance). Sources: portorocha.com/about, LinkedIn company page, web search.",
